@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Pipeline Artifacts - Detail

skinparam shadowing false
top to bottom direction

artifact "RawDocument JSONL" as Raw
artifact "accepted.jsonl" as Candidates
artifact "filtered.jsonl" as Filtered
artifact "train / validation / test" as Splits
artifact "adapter + GGUF" as Model
artifact "scorecards + comparison" as Scores

Raw --> Candidates : synthesis
Candidates --> Filtered : quality policy
Filtered --> Splits : transforms + grouped split
Splits --> Model : LoRA SFT
Model --> Scores : held-out evaluation

note bottom
Every stage also writes a stage-scoped manifest.
Canonical records remain model-neutral until packaging.
end note

@enduml
